{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0041","paragraphs":[{"id":"pa383db107a71-1","text":"莫听穿林打叶声。"},{"id":"p918afb432ca9-1","text":"何妨吟啸且徐行。"},{"id":"pd60169f1155b-1","text":"竹杖芒鞋轻胜马。"},{"id":"pf40535e86d0c-1","text":"谁怕。"},{"id":"p1cda1fa7b3b6-1","text":"一蓑烟雨任平生。"},{"id":"p9e05e725ad63-1","text":"料峭春风吹酒醒。"},{"id":"p3eb0cc9bac0c-1","text":"微冷。"},{"id":"pde4e5d2ad06e-1","text":"山头斜照却相迎。"},{"id":"pf9ee6676ab34-1","text":"回首向来萧瑟处。"},{"id":"pffe3aff8da3e-1","text":"归去。"},{"id":"p2244ccc696a0-1","text":"也无风雨也无晴。"}]}